    },
    {
      "change": "Made the opt-in, off-peak pilot with published results part of the idea, not just a risk mitigation note.",
      "reason": "It answers merchant throughput concerns and the gimmick criticism, and gives a sustained, evidence-led programme."
    },
    {
      "change": "Stated the lane's purpose as 'for anyone who wants to take their time', and not as a service for lonely people.",
      "reason": "Avoids stigma and keeps the idea honest: nobody has to identify as lonely, and the lane stays appealing to everyone."
    },
    {
