    "title": "Paid For This",
    "idea": "A first paycheck is a receipt for the first time someone believed your work was worth paying for. Yet we photograph the payslip and hide the work. 'Paid for This' flips that. People share the first thing they were paid to make or do (a menu, a pitch deck, a flyer, a logo, a rota) with the amount hidden and a feeling or story in its place. A simple Canva template makes the card. It launches with real first-work stories from creators, interns and small-business owners, appears in OOH as the work itself, and extends into employer and school onboarding. Canva becomes the tool behind work worth being paid for.",
