      "change": "Reframed the idea from a Mastercard-designed 'slower payment sound' to a merchant-led signal. Merchants choose when they have a minute, show a simple counter mark, and the customer opts in by pausing their tap. The sonic identity becomes a supporting cue and is no longer the core mechanic.",
