      "change": "Added an explicit admission of the cost of speed to the launch narrative: 'We made paying faster. Here's a reason to slow down.'",
      "reason": "This answers the 'isn't Mastercard the reason things got faster?' challenge head on. Candour turns the biggest credibility risk into the reason to believe."
    },
    {
      "change": "Narrowed the launch to a committed group of independent cafes, markets, newsagents and corner shops, running in quiet-hour windows and in a few chosen neighbourhoods before any wider rollout.",
